HP's Calculator (com.palm.calculator), as modernized by webOS Archive: version 3.2.0, "Calculator
(webOS CE)", from the WOSA Modernize feed (com.palm.app.calculator_3.2.0_all.ipk). It adds a
scientific layout in landscape, parentheses with operator precedence, and an expression line
above the readout; portrait is the stock keypad. Its folder is com.palm.app.calculator, as on
the device; webOS takes the app's id from appinfo.json.

The original is copyright Palm, Inc. / Hewlett-Packard, never released under an open licence;
distributed by Lunacy as abandonware, like Mojo, the Prelude fonts and the TouchPad wallpapers:
no owner has asserted rights since webOS was discontinued. The 3.2.0 changes are webOS
Archive's.

The app's files are here exactly as the package carries them, and Lunacy does not change them
(rule 5 in CLAUDE.md). The package's own copy of its resources under usr/palm/packages is left
out; nothing else is.
